# Go Get the Calculator (Q347): a level 12 character accepts at Brunon through his four pages;
# Silvera has nothing yet; Balanki takes 100 adena (cond 2) and Spiron finishes the pair (cond
# 4); both elders then send him on; Silvera asks for crystals (cond 5); Brunon has no calculator
# yet; ten gemstone beasts give ten crystals (every roll pinned to succeed) and an eleventh
# nothing; Silvera builds the calculator (cond 6); Brunon trades it for the real one and the
# quest ends; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q347_go_get_the_calculator.golden
character Calculator 12
hold 57 1000
random always 0
script quest.Q347_GoGetTheCalculator
item 57 4285 4286 4393
page trainer/30526.htm
page trainer/30527.htm
page default/30532.htm
page default/30533.htm
page script/quest/Q347_GoGetTheCalculator/
npc brunon 30526 Trainer 10 0 0
npc silvera 30527 Trainer -10 0 0
npc spiron 30532 Folk 0 10 0
npc balanki 30533 Folk 0 -10 0
npc beast 20540 Monster 40 0 0

# Brunon: accept through 30526-02, 03 and 04.
action brunon
action brunon
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=brunon item=0 page=trainer/30526.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{brunon}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=brunon item=0 page=script/quest/Q347_GoGetTheCalculator/30526-01.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest Q347_GoGetTheCalculator 30526-02.htm
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=brunon item=0 page=script/quest/Q347_GoGetTheCalculator/30526-02.htm
  S ActionFailed
